{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104061","id":2390356373,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OefGV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104061","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104061.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104061.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104061","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104061/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104061/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104061/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/163c8be88412e2ca22cb24efd1802f3bcb7e3002","number":104061,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve default/no query quick open dialog behavior","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99672\r\nClose #103558\r\n\r\nThis change primarily removes `SHOW_ALL_FILES_THRESHOLD` and was motivated by someone thinking quick open had a regression after having saved 31 instances of some resource. The two default/empty query behaviors (show all, show history) are combined such that up to `filesystem/quick_open_dialog/max_results` results are shown, prioritizing items in history and matching the tie-break ordering used by fuzzy search.\r\n\r\nSeparately, this fixes a minor bug where elements in history try to get a resource preview using their uid string and end up displaying the default icon. The cache file still saves by uid rather than by path.\r\n\r\nPerformance wise (on a project with ~700 resource files) this adds 1ms to the initialization time for the popup but saves 3ms while updating the results (for both popup and query changes). Both versions have a 360ms first launch time and 100ms display mode switch time; maybe those could be improved in the future.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","